flowchart TD
    A[Detecting Suspicious Activity on Social Media] --> B{Type of Activity?}
    
    B -->|Suspicious Message| C[Check for Scam Signals]
    C --> C1[Check grammar/unusual syntax errors]
    C1 --> C2[Assess requests for sensitive info]
    C2 --> C3[Evaluate urgency in message]
    C3 --> G
    
    B -->|Unknown Account| D[Verify Account Credibility]
    D --> D1[Check follower/following ratio]
    D1 --> D2[Review account age]
    D2 --> D3[Verify profile authenticity]
    D3 --> G
    
    B -->|Suspicious Link| E[URL Assessment]
    E --> E1[Check URL shortening services]
    E1 --> E2[Verify domain name]
    E2 --> E3[Analyze context around links]
    E3 --> G
    
    B -->|Questionable Ad| F[Ad Analysis]
    F --> F1[Evaluate emotional/sensational content]
    F1 --> F2[Check third-party apps]
    F2 --> G
    
    G{Confirmed Scam?}
    
    G -->|Yes| H[Preventive Measures]
    H --> H1[Report to social media platform]
    H1 --> H2[Block suspicious accounts]
    H2 --> H3[Update privacy settings]
    H3 --> H4[Clear browsing history]
    H4 --> H5[Enable two-factor authentication]
    H5 --> H6[Change to strong passwords]
    H6 --> J
    
    G -->|No| I[Continue Monitoring]
    I --> I1[Stay informed about new scams]
    I1 --> I2[Regularly check security software]
    I2 --> J
    
    J[Maintain Continuous Vigilance]